---
title: Scheduler Control Loop
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle: Scheduler starts

    Idle --> EventReceived: vLLM metrics update
    Idle --> EventReceived: Cluster event
    Idle --> EventReceived: SLA breach
    Idle --> EventReceived: New app onboarded
    Idle --> EventReceived: Timer tick (60s)

    EventReceived --> Debounce: Coalesce events

    Debounce --> AcquireLock: Debounce window expires

    AcquireLock --> SnapshotState: Lock acquired
    AcquireLock --> Idle: Lock held by another instance

    SnapshotState --> ComputeScaling: Snapshot WorldState

    state ComputeScaling {
        [*] --> ForEachApp
        ForEachApp --> CalculateTarget: Next app
        CalculateTarget --> ForEachApp: More apps
        CalculateTarget --> [*]: All apps processed
    }

    ComputeScaling --> CheckStabilityControls: Scaling decisions ready

    state CheckStabilityControls {
        [*] --> CheckCooldowns: For each app
        CheckCooldowns --> CheckStabilization: Cooldowns pass
        CheckCooldowns --> SuppressChange: In cooldown period
        CheckStabilization --> AllowChange: 3+ consecutive signals
        CheckStabilization --> SuppressChange: Insufficient signals
        SuppressChange --> [*]: Keep current count
        AllowChange --> [*]: Apply new target
    }

    CheckStabilityControls --> RunPlanner: Stabilized scaling decisions

    state RunPlanner {
        [*] --> PrimaryPlan
        PrimaryPlan --> [*]: PlannerResult ready
        --
        [*] --> ShadowPlan: shadow mode only
        ShadowPlan --> [*]: metrics recorded\n(result discarded)
    }

    RunPlanner --> ValidatePlan: PlannerResult generated

    ValidatePlan --> Execute: Sanity checks pass
    ValidatePlan --> Idle: Invalid plan, log error

    state Execute {
        [*] --> OrderOperations
        OrderOperations --> ExecutePreemptions: Preemptions first
        ExecutePreemptions --> ExecuteScaleDowns: Wait for termination
        ExecuteScaleDowns --> ExecuteScaleUps: Capacity freed
        ExecuteScaleUps --> ExecuteMigrations: Scale-ups done
        ExecuteMigrations --> WaitForRunning: Blue-green pairs
        WaitForRunning --> [*]: All ops running or failed
    }

    Execute --> ReleaseLock: Execution complete

    ReleaseLock --> LogResult: Lock released

    LogResult --> Idle: Record metrics,<br/>emit events

    note right of Debounce
        Coalesce multiple events
        within 1-2s window to
        prevent thrashing
    end note

    note right of AcquireLock
        Distributed lock for HA
        Only leader processes events
    end note

    note right of CheckStabilityControls
        Scale-up: no stabilization delay
        (responsiveness > stability)
        Scale-down: 3 consecutive signals
        SLA breach: bypass all controls
    end note

    note right of RunPlanner
        planner.Plan(snap, targets) called
        once per tick. Backend selected by
        SCHEDULATOR_PLANNER_MODE env var:
        • heuristic (default): PlacementEngine
          then RebalancingEngine sequentially
        • solver: CP-SAT joint optimizer,
          shadow cap pre-pass; falls back
          to heuristic on timeout
        • shadow: primary runs on hot path,
          shadow runs in detached goroutine
          for A/B metric comparison only

        PrimaryPlan and ShadowPlan are
        concurrent regions; ShadowPlan is
        active only in shadow mode.
    end note

    note right of Execute
        Operations dispatched
        to cluster clients
        in parallel where possible.
        Reservations created before
        dispatch, fulfilled/expired
        on completion/timeout.
        Shadow-slot migrations sequenced
        before dependent scale-ups.
    end note
